{"task_id": "Mbpp/68", "solution": "```python\ndef is_Monotonic(array: list) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if the given array is monotonic (either increasing or decreasing).\"\"\"\n\n    def _is_monotonically_increasing(arr: list) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if the array is monotonically increasing (arr[i] <= arr[j] for i <= j).\"\"\"\n        for i in range(len(arr) - 1):\n            if arr[i] > arr[i + 1]:\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    def _is_monotonically_decreasing(arr: list) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if the array is monotonically decreasing (arr[i] >= arr[j] for i <= j).\"\"\"\n        for i in range(len(arr) - 1):\n            if arr[i] < arr[i + 1]:\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    if len(array) <= 1:\n        return True\n\n    return _is_monotonically_increasing(array) or _is_monotonically_decreasing(array)\n```"}
