{"task_id": "Mbpp/71", "solution": "def comb_sort(elements: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Sorts a list of comparable elements in ascending order using the Comb Sort algorithm.\n    Returns a new list with the sorted elements.\"\"\"\n    n = len(elements)\n    arr = list(elements)  # Create a mutable copy of the input list\n\n    gap = n\n    shrink_factor = 1.3\n    swapped = True\n\n    while gap > 1 or swapped:\n        # Calculate the new gap value\n        gap = int(gap / shrink_factor)\n        if gap < 1:\n            gap = 1\n\n        swapped = False\n        # Perform a single pass through the list for the current gap\n        for i in range(n - gap):\n            if arr[i] > arr[i + gap]:\n                arr[i], arr[i + gap] = arr[i + gap], arr[i]\n                swapped = True\n    return arr"}
