{"task_id": "Mbpp/172", "solution": "def count_occurance(input_string: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the non-overlapping occurrences of the substring 'std' in the input_string.\n    The counting is case-sensitive.\n    \"\"\"\n    target_substring = \"std\"\n    count = 0\n    start_index = 0\n    while True:\n        index = input_string.find(target_substring, start_index)\n        if index == -1: # No more occurrences found.\n            break\n        count += 1\n        start_index = index + len(target_substring) # Move past the found occurrence for non-overlapping count.\n    return count"}
