{"task_id": "Mbpp/265", "solution": "def list_split(input_list: list, n: int) -> list[list]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Splits a list for every nth element, returning a list of the resulting lists.\n    Elements are distributed such that `element[i]` goes into `output_list[i % n]`.\n    \"\"\"\n    output_lists = [[] for _ in range(n)]\n\n    for index, element in enumerate(input_list):\n        target_sublist_index = index % n\n        output_lists[target_sublist_index].append(element)\n\n    return output_lists"}
