{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "def even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of even-indexed binomial coefficients for a given positive integer n.\n    e.g., C(n, 0) + C(n, 2) + C(n, 4) + ...\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def _validate_positive_integer(val: int) -> None:\n        \"\"\"Validates that the input n is a positive integer.\"\"\"\n        if val <= 0:\n            raise ValueError(\"n must be a positive integer\")\n\n    def _binomial_coefficient(n_val: int, k_val: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Calculates the binomial coefficient C(n, k).\"\"\"\n        if k_val < 0 or k_val > n_val:\n            return 0\n        if k_val == 0 or k_val == n_val:\n            return 1\n        if k_val > n_val // 2:\n            k_val = n_val - k_val\n\n        res = 1\n        for i in range(k_val):\n            res = res * (n_val - i) // (i + 1)\n        return res\n\n    _validate_positive_integer(n)\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    for k in range(0, n + 1, 2):\n        total_sum += _binomial_coefficient(n, k)\n\n    return total_sum"}
