{"task_id": "Mbpp/391", "solution": "def convert_list_dictionary(identifiers: list, names: list, values: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Converts three parallel lists (identifiers, names, values) into a list of nested dictionaries.\n    Each resulting dictionary has the structure: {'identifier_value': {'name_value': numeric_value}}.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not (len(identifiers) == len(names) == len(values)):\n        raise ValueError(\"Input lists must have the same length.\")\n\n    if not identifiers:\n        return []\n\n    result = []\n    for i in range(len(identifiers)):\n        identifier = identifiers[i]\n        name = names[i]\n        value = values[i]\n        nested_dict = {name: value}\n        top_level_dict = {identifier: nested_dict}\n        result.append(top_level_dict)\n    return result"}
