{"task_id": "Mbpp/419", "solution": "import math\n\ndef round_and_sum(numbers):\n    \"\"\"\n    Rounds each number in the given list (0.5 rounds away from zero), calculates the sum of rounded numbers,\n    multiplies the sum by the list's length, and returns the final value.\n    \"\"\"\n    list_length = len(numbers)\n    if list_length == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    rounded_numbers = [int(math.copysign(math.floor(abs(n) + 0.5), n)) for n in numbers]\n    sum_of_rounded_numbers = sum(rounded_numbers)\n    final_calculated_value = sum_of_rounded_numbers * list_length\n    return final_calculated_value"}
