{"task_id": "Mbpp/428", "solution": "from typing import List, Union\n\ndef shell_sort(input_list: List[Union[int, float]]) -> List[Union[int, float]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Sorts a list of numbers in ascending order using the Shell Sort algorithm.\n    Modifies the input list in-place and returns it.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(input_list)\n    gap = n // 2\n\n    while gap > 0:\n        for i in range(gap, n):\n            temp = input_list[i]\n            j = i\n            while j >= gap and input_list[j - gap] > temp:\n                input_list[j] = input_list[j - gap]\n                j -= gap\n            input_list[j] = temp\n        gap //= 2\n    return input_list"}
