{"task_id": "Mbpp/556", "solution": "def find_Odd_Pair(list_of_integers: list, list_size: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts pairs of integers in a list whose bitwise XOR operation results in an odd number.\n    \"\"\"\n    odd_xor_pair_count = 0\n    for i in range(list_size):\n        for j in range(i + 1, list_size):\n            val_a = list_of_integers[i]\n            val_b = list_of_integers[j]\n            xor_result = val_a ^ val_b\n            if xor_result % 2 != 0:\n                odd_xor_pair_count += 1\n    return odd_xor_pair_count"}
