{"task_id": "Mbpp/559", "solution": "def max_sub_array_sum(numbers: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the maximum sum of a contiguous sublist within the given list of integers.\n    It uses Kadane's algorithm to efficiently find this sum.\n    \"\"\"\n    max_so_far = numbers[0]\n    current_max = numbers[0]\n\n    for i in range(1, len(numbers)):\n        number = numbers[i]\n        current_max = max(number, current_max + number)\n        max_so_far = max(max_so_far, current_max)\n\n    return max_so_far"}
