{"task_id": "Mbpp/633", "solution": "def pair_xor_Sum(numbers: list) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of XORs for all unique pairs in the given list.\"\"\"\n    total_xor_sum = 0\n    n = len(numbers)\n\n    # Iterate through all unique pairs (i, j) where i < j\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            total_xor_sum += (numbers[i] ^ numbers[j])\n\n    return total_xor_sum"}
