{"task_id": "Mbpp/638", "solution": "def wind_chill(velocity: float, temperature: float) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the wind chill index given the wind velocity in km/h and temperature in Celsius.\n    The result is rounded to the nearest integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    if velocity < 0.1: # Treat very low velocity as effectively 0 for WCI purposes\n        return round(temperature)\n\n    v_power_0_16 = velocity**0.16\n\n    wci = (13.12 +\n           0.6215 * temperature -\n           11.37 * v_power_0_16 +\n           0.3965 * temperature * v_power_0_16)\n\n    return round(wci)"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/644", "solution": "def reverse_Array_Upto_K(array: list, k: int) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Reverses the elements of an array from the beginning up to a given 1-indexed position k in-place.\"\"\"\n    if not array or k <= 0:\n        return array\n\n    # Determine the actual number of elements to reverse\n    count_to_reverse = min(k, len(array))\n\n    left = 0\n    right = count_to_reverse - 1\n\n    while left < right:\n        array[left], array[right] = array[right], array[left]\n        left += 1\n        right -= 1\n\n    return array"}
