{"task_id": "Mbpp/734", "solution": "def sum_Of_Subarray_Prod(input_list: list) -> (int | float):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of products of all possible contiguous sublists of the given list.\n    The function iterates through all possible sublists, computes their products, and sums them up.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    n = len(input_list)\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        current_product = 1\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            current_product *= input_list[j]\n            total_sum += current_product\n    return total_sum"}
