{"task_id": "Mbpp/743", "solution": "def rotate_right(input_list: list, rotation_count: int) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Rotates a list to the right by a specified number of items.\"\"\"\n    if not input_list:\n        return []\n\n    n = len(input_list)\n    effective_rotation_count = rotation_count % n\n    \n    # Split the list into two parts and concatenate them in the rotated order.\n    # The elements from `n - effective_rotation_count` to the end move to the front.\n    return input_list[n - effective_rotation_count:] + input_list[:n - effective_rotation_count]"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/748", "solution": "def capital_words_spaces(input_string: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Inserts spaces before uppercase letters in a string, except for the first character.\n    Returns the original string if no uppercase letters are found after the first character.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_string:\n        return \"\"\n\n    result = [input_string[0]]\n    for char in input_string[1:]:\n        if char.isupper() and result[-1] != ' ':\n            result.append(' ')\n        result.append(char)\n\n    processed_string = \"\".join(result)\n    return processed_string if processed_string != input_string else input_string"}
